    "text": "[panel=5]思考之際，殺氣自後方襲來。\n你立刻閃身一躲，恰好避開索命刀鋒。",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);\nDisableAllCharacterExpression();\nPlayOrStopParticle(Sword_Single_ScreenWhite,Play);\nSetGameObjectShake(P0,ShakeNormalGradually, XAxis,0.5,10,0.1);\nSetContinueMode(original)@1;",
